      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "装备牌与地牢牌混洗后共同铺到棋盘，每层房间都由牌组塑形",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Your equipment cards and the cards of the dungeon are shuffled together and placed on the board, creating a unique challenge every time!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2638050/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "所有行动只需单击，没有背包、菜单与拖牌，却保留完整回合策略",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Simple UI, Complex Strategy: every single one of your actions is a simple click. No inventory management, no menus, no card dragging, no busywork. Just pure turn based strategy and tactics!",
